WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:16.623
stood before Guanyin.

2
00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:21.705
He was telling the bodhisattva everything that had happened at the monastery.

3
00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:27.307
"Then a bear spirit called the Black Wind King stole the robe," the monkey went on.

4
00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.948
"I demanded he give it back.

5
00:00:31.712 --> 00:00:35.474
We fought—until the bear spirit said it was lunchtime and hid in his cave.

6
00:00:37.315 --> 00:00:40.657
I kicked the door and yelled insults at him for more than an hour.

7
00:00:41.658 --> 00:00:42.478
he wouldn't come out.

8
00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:46.040
You must help me."

9
00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.342
Guanyin sighed.

10
00:00:49.362 --> 00:00:54.765
"The Tang Monk should not have shown that robe to the priest," she said.

11
00:00:54.785 --> 00:00:57.807
"The robe is a Buddhist treasure.

12
00:00:58.987 --> 00:01:01.633
When other people see it, they will want it.

13
00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:08.176
And as that head priest tried to do, they might harm the Tang Monk."

14
00:01:08.196 --> 00:01:10.618
"I agree," said Wukong.

15
00:01:10.638 --> 00:01:14.900
"I've told the Tang Monk many times not to do dumb things.

16
00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:23.025
But still he—" "And you should have put out that fire," Guanyin said, interrupting Wukong.

17
00:01:23.045 --> 00:01:26.367
"What you did was terrible!"

18
00:01:26.387 --> 00:01:28.628
Wukong looked at the ground.

19
00:01:30.384 --> 00:01:31.125
kicked a pebble.

20
00:01:31.145 --> 00:01:34.447
"I know," he mumbled.

21
00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:38.829
"I'll help you get back the robe," said Guanyin.

22
00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:40.490
"Let's go."

23
00:01:41.771 --> 00:01:44.452
Wukong and Guanyin soared over the ocean.

24
00:01:46.453 --> 00:01:48.014
Soon they landed on the mountain.

25
00:01:48.034 --> 00:01:52.917
"Where is the Black Wind King's cave?"

26
00:01:53.317 --> 00:01:54.098
asked Guanyin.

27
00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:56.559
close," said Wukong.

28
00:01:56.579 --> 00:01:59.292
"We should sneak up to it."

29
00:01:59.392 --> 00:02:01.113
They heard footsteps coming closer.

30
00:02:01.894 --> 00:02:06.157
Wukong and Guanyin hid as a Daoist priest walked along the path.

31
00:02:07.018 --> 00:02:08.299
priest was holding a tray.

32
00:02:09.219 --> 00:02:11.501
A bright purple pill sat on the tray.

33
00:02:12.782 --> 00:02:14.163
priest was talking to himself.

34
00:02:15.884 --> 00:02:17.605
"This is an exciting day," he said.

35
00:02:18.746 --> 00:02:21.768
"The Black Wind King has a new robe that is a Buddhist treasure.

36
00:02:22.649 --> 00:02:24.470
And I hope he likes the pill I made for him.

37
00:02:25.351 --> 00:02:26.672
It will make him live forever."

38
00:02:31.168 --> 00:02:34.589
Wukong stared at the priest, using his magic sight.

39
00:02:38.891 --> 00:02:39.912
"That's not a priest!"

40
00:02:40.312 --> 00:02:41.312
Wukong realized.

41
00:02:42.193 --> 00:02:43.993
a wolf spirit dressed as a priest."

42
00:02:45.514 --> 00:02:46.654
The monkey's eyes lit up.

43
00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.776
"I have an idea, Bodhisattva!"

44
00:02:52.157 --> 00:02:56.578
A little while later, the priest stood before the Black Wind King's cave door.

45
00:02:58.299 --> 00:03:00.000
He knocked and the door flew open.

46
00:03:02.016 --> 00:03:04.979
"Are you still here, you little monkey?"

47
00:03:05.379 --> 00:03:06.740
shouted the Black Wind King.

48
00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.603
he saw the priest and smiled.

49
00:03:09.623 --> 00:03:12.345
"Oh, it's you, my old friend!

50
00:03:13.546 --> 00:03:14.087
for yelling.

51
00:03:14.107 --> 00:03:18.310
A pesky monkey spirit was here a little while ago."

52
00:03:19.731 --> 00:03:20.352
looked around.

53
00:03:20.372 --> 00:03:22.073
"I guess he's gone."

54
00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:25.176
"A monkey spirit was here?"

55
00:03:25.516 --> 00:03:26.377
asked the priest.

56
00:03:26.397 --> 00:03:29.400
"Yes," said the bear.

57
00:03:30.184 --> 00:03:32.947
kept banging on my door and yelling at me.

58
00:03:33.627 --> 00:03:35.009
He was very rude."

59
00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.973
The Black Wind King patted the priest on the shoulder.

60
00:03:39.993 --> 00:03:43.636
"But let's not talk about him.

61
00:03:44.637 --> 00:03:45.378
good to see you.

62
00:03:46.058 --> 00:03:46.839
How have you been?"

63
00:03:46.919 --> 00:03:50.222
"I'm well," said the priest.

64
00:03:50.242 --> 00:03:54.205
"I brought you a gift, to celebrate your new Buddhist treasure."

65
00:03:55.206 --> 00:03:56.948
He held up the tray with the pill.

66
00:03:58.008 --> 00:04:00.130
Black Wind King looked interested.

67
00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.652
"What kind of pill is that?"

68
00:04:03.993 --> 00:04:06.875
"It is a very special pill," said the priest with a smile.

69
00:04:08.015 --> 00:04:08.956
made it just for you.

70
00:04:09.677 --> 00:04:11.078
It will make you live forever."

71
00:04:12.198 --> 00:04:14.540
The Black Wind King stroked his chin.

72
00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:20.724
"You know, I was just thinking this morning that I would like to live forever."

73
00:04:22.606 --> 00:04:25.548
The bear picked up the pill and opened his mouth wide.

74
00:04:26.452 --> 00:04:29.535
As he brought the pill up to his mouth, the pill wiggled.

75
00:04:29.555 --> 00:04:37.842
"Huh? Did the pill just—" But before the Black Wind King could finish speaking, the pill hopped off

76
00:04:37.902 --> 00:04:38.403
his hand.

77
00:04:39.584 --> 00:04:42.466
It shot into his mouth and slid down his throat.
